  "prose_only": {
    "_doc": "Glossary entries whose adoption is asserted only in free-text fields (optimizer, rl_method, moe.routing, data_mix_notes, stability_notes...). The schema has no typed slot for them, so their 'Used by' tables CANNOT be generated and stay hand-maintained. Listed here so the coverage report can distinguish 'no structured backing by design' from 'drift we should fix'. Promoting any of these to a typed slot is a schema change, not a registry change.",
